graph-nl
    title Component Architecture - Sentinel

    subgraph API Process
        Router[API Routers (/jobs)] --> Service[Job Service Layer]
        Service --> Schema[Pydantic Validation Schemas]
        Service --> DBAdapter[(SQLAlchemy Async Session)]
        Service --> QueueAdapter[RQ Queue Client]
    end

    subgraph Worker Process
        WorkerMain[RQ Worker Loop] --> TaskExec[Task Handlers]
        TaskExec --> DBAdapterWorker[(SQLAlchemy Async Session)]
    end

    subgraph Infrastructure
        DBAdapter -->|asyncpg| PostgreSQL[(PostgreSQL 16)]
        DBAdapterWorker -->|asyncpg| PostgreSQL
        QueueAdapter -->|TCP| Redis[(Redis Broker)]
        WorkerMain -->|TCP| Redis
    end
